        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Taquero, his tacos of dubious origin, and you, an office worker who left work late and avoids becoming dinner for a strange creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180960/extras/6a83a142635bd76ab5479c5d65776f82.avif?t=1777581905\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180960/extras_big/6a83a142635bd76ab5479c5d65776f82.webp?t=1777581905 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from the house of this “demonic chef” before you become his next ingredient.  Hide from his clutches while you search for a way out of this dark house with a tragic past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180960/extras/2172d85245b5f343e7badc2f6cf09312.avif?t=1777581905\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180960/extras_big/2172d85245b5f343e7badc2f6cf09312.webp?t=1777581905 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through the hallways and rooms of this strange house, solve puzzles to find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180960/extras/07a46de531a3f9d5fbfdd902230cfb3a.poster.avif?t=1777581905\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180960/extras/07a46de531a3f9d5fbfdd902230cfb3a.webm?t=1777581905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta